{
  "_readme": [
    "WO-25 door 1 — the care-anchor roster: hospitals whose OWN sites get read",
    "for what each states (clinic rosters, insurance/international desks,",
    "checkup packages), plus the two official paper sources (DTV, VA FMP).",
    "Read by importers/read_care_sites.py, which verifies before it believes:",
    "a candidate URL counts as the hospital's own site only when the fetched",
    "page carries one of the `expect` tokens — a guessed domain that fails",
    "verification is recorded as unresolved, never read as the hospital.",
    "urls[] are CANDIDATES in preference order, stored ones first (from the",
    "crawl or linkhealth), guesses after. placeIds bind the target to the",
    "catalogue records (dupes listed; merges are door 5's job).",
    "Snapshots land in cache/care/<key>/, verdicts in cache/care/manifest.json.",
    "Nothing here writes to data/curated/care.json — the register is curated",
    "by hand from the snapshots, every claim carrying src + fetched."
  ],
